  "id": "dill-and-shrimp-salad",
  "name": "Dill and Shrimp Salad",
  "subtitle": "A bright, creamy chilled salad",
  "description": "Cooked shrimp, crisp vegetables, citrus, mayonnaise, and fresh dill come together in a simple salad for eight servings.",
